                    {
                        "sense_id": "e7715733-9b5a-39d1-9954-3f61541e9cee",
                        "entry_id": "9edcb919-83bb-3b12-a2e4-7786df356346",
                        "glosses": [
                            "fifteen-copeck coin"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bb5422e-3c66-4954-991e-2d04d68f927f",
                                "sense_id": "e7715733-9b5a-39d1-9954-3f61541e9cee",
                                "text": "Меня́ назва́л ещё раз дурако́м, а изво́зчику дал пятиалты́нный и часы́ мне купи́л сере́бряные с золоты́м ободо́чком и с цепо́чкой.",
                                "translation": "He called me a fool one more time, gave the cabby fifteen kopecks, and bought me a silver watch with a gold rim and a chain.",
                                "english": "He called me a fool one more time, gave the cabby fifteen kopecks, and bought me a silver watch with a gold rim and a chain."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
